{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07488","headline":"送孔巢父赴河南军 · 刘长卿","name":"送孔巢父赴河南军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南相送隔烟波，况复新秋一鴈过。\n闻道全军征北虏，又言诗将会南河。\n边心冉冉乡人绝，寒色青青战马多。\n共许陈琳工奏记，知君名行未蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}